Modification: the TDNN speaker-embedding module of that model was traced and
exported to ONNX (opset 17) with torch.onnx. No weights were retrained or
altered. The feature frontend (filterbank + per-utterance normalisation) could
not be traced and is therefore NOT part of the exported graph; its exact
parameters are documented in README.md and reimplemented in reference/fbank.py.

